Z||000001||MinnGreenGT||12-26-2001||02:11 PM||||It's supposed to light up red.  There are 2 standard 194 bulbs on each side.  Easy to replace.<P>Edit: Here's Grinthock's (sp?) silver GT at night- you can see the illuminated Pontiac<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fuzzyneon2.jpg"> <P>Also, if you read this thread: <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/011212.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/011212.html</A>  it tells about how I removed my red inserts and replaced the white bulbs with green ones (there are pics too).<P>------------------<BR>                <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/GreenGT6.gif">   <P>Fixed image tags... oops.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><p>[This message has been edited by MinnGreenGT (edited 12-26-2001).]||||reg||1
